global.dialogueStringArrays = {


	hillsWarpRoomGuy : [ 
	
		"My, my, my! You're quite the inquisitive one, aren't you? Did someone tell you about this room, you trailblazer?", //0
		"Looking to jump ahead? Save file corrupted but don't want to start from scratch? Then look no further!",
		"Welcome to the [wave][rainbow]WARP ROOM![/wave][/rainbow] Pick any door to instantly warp to the start of that chapter!",
		"Of course, if this is your first playthrough you probably won't want to skip a bunch of stuff. But it's your call!",
		"Go ahead, pick a door! Or you can go back the way you came if you want a regular ol' playthrough.",
	
	],
	
	hillsWarpRoomForest : [ 
	
		"Forest", //0
	
	],
	
	hillsWarpRoomCave : [ 
	
		"Cave", //0
	
	],
	
	hillsWarpRoomLab : [ 
	
		"Lab", //0
	
	],
	
	hillsWarpRoomSewer : [ 
	
		"Sewer", //0
	
	],
	
	hillsWarpRoomVolcano : [ 
	
		"Volcano", //0
	
	],
	
	forestTreeCarving : [ 
	
		"\"S + H\" is carved into the tree.", //0
	
	],
	
	forestContainmentFailure : [ 
	
		"Containment status: FAILURE. Subject hazard level: 10/10. [c_red]DANGER IMMINENT. LEAVE VICINITY NOW.",
	
	],
	
	forestJournalEntry : [ 
	
		"Log Entry No. {data_corrupt} \nTreatment failed. Again. Nothing I try works. Nothing.",
		"At this rate my body will almost certainly {data_corrupt} before I succeed.",
		//"There is only one other option now. I don't like to gamble, but what choice do I have?",
		"There is only one other option now. I don't like to gamble, but what choice do I have?",
		"A lab in a cave. What an assinine idea that turned out to be.",
		//"A lab in a cave. Turned out to be as assinine in practice as it is cliche.",
		"I just wish I could say sorry. [slant]-S",
	
	],
	
	cavesEntanceExplorer : [ 
	
		"Ho hum. It would appear the great Beckett has been momentarily stumped yet again.", //0
		"Sadly, this time I fear a way forward is a moot gesture.",
		"Or, to put it another way: this is the end of the demo.",
		"We sincerely thank you for your time, and we hope you enjoyed.",
		//"If you enjoyed, why not purchase wishlist Seeing Double on Steam? It would really help us out.",
		"If you enjoyed, why not purchase the full version of Seeing Double on Steam? It would really help us out.",
		"Thanks again, and until next time.", //5
	
	],
	
	cavesEntanceMiner : [ 
	
		"[shake]D-d-did you s-s-see th-that!? That was a bloody g-g-ghost!! And it busted through solid rock like it was nothing!", //0
		//"W-was that a g-g-ghost?", 
	//	"That [slant]does[/slant] it! That's the [slant]last[/slant] straw! I do [slant]NOT[/slant] get paid enough for this nonsense! I [shake]quit!!", 
		"That right [slant]does[/slant] it! That simply teas my crumpets! I do [slant]NOT[/slant] get paid enough for this balderdash!", 
		"I [slant]quit!![/slant] If the boss wants his ore so bad that fat tub o' lard can come down here and say 'ello to ol' spooky himself!!", 
		//"If the boss wants his ore so damn bad he can come down here and say hello to ol' spooky himselves!!", 
		"What? You want to go [slant]into[/slant] that deathtrap and find some science lab? [shake]HaHAA![/shake] That deserves a right good laugh!", 
		"There's nothing in that cave except rocks and misery, my deluded blue blowhard. You should save yourself the time and go home, bloke.", 
		"As for me? I'll happily find a new way to make a living. One that doesn't require making acquaintance to wailing banshees!", //5
		"Tally ho, imbecile!",
		//"The mines have become a deathtrap recently.", 
		//"The mines have become a deathtrap recently. Someone's gotta do it, though.", 
	//	"And that someone ain't me! I'll find another way to make a living. One free of killer ghosts!", 
	//	"Y!", 
	//	"Mine for ore, I mean. It's pretty much the only way to make a living, ain't it?", 
	//	"Mine for ore, I mean. It's pretty much the only way to make a living, ain't it?", 
		
	],
	
	cavesDiary : [ 
	
		//"A house in cave. He really does get the craziest ideas.", 
		"He really does get the craziest ideas. Building a house in a cave? Who'd think of that?", 
		"But I have to admit it's beautiful in this little alcove, tucked away from the world. And so much to study, too!", 
		"I reckon there's hundreds - no, [slant]thousands[/slant] of unknown fungi waiting to be discovered. How exciting!", 
		"Oh, he's giving me that look... I might have to wrap this entry up~", 
		//"Wait a minute... He's peeking at my journal again!! Son of a-", 
		//"Wait a minute... He's peeking at my journal again!! That sneaky rat!", 
		"Wait a minute... no he's not! He's peeking at my journal! [/slant]Again!!", 
		"Simon, if you ever read this I SWEAR I'll kill you.", 
		
	],
	
	cavesCamper : [ 
	
		"Huh... so ya found my little hidey hole, eh sonny? Like what I've done with the place?",
		"What brings ya down to these cavernous depths? Ya don't look like a miner. Or an explorer.",
		"Ya looking for something? Or someone? Heh. Good luck finding anything in these pits.",
		"Y'know. These caves connect to some sort of hi tech facility deeper in.",
		"Seems like it's been there for ages, too. Makes me wonder who built it, and why.",
		"Could never figure out how to open that door, though, so we'll probably never know.",
		"But... you seem like a resourceful young feller. Maybe you'll succeed where I couldn't.",
		"And who knows? Maybe inside you'll find just what you're looking fer.",
		
	],
	
	cavesCamperMore : [ 
	
		"What brings ya back here, sonny? Wondering why I'm holed up in this little nook, that it?",
		"Well, to put it simply... I like explorin'. Findin' little unknown places like this...",
		"It makes me feel so young! Like a kid, almost. Guess I never quite grew up, heheh.",
		"Y'know, sonny... between you and me... I've seen things you probably wouldn't believe.",
		"There's a whole 'nother world out there. And I ain't talkin' 'bout beyond the island.",
		//"It's right here, all around us. In this very room even, I'd wager.",
		"It's right here, all around us. In this very room even.",
		"Heh. You must think I'm crazy. I used to get that a lot. Part of the reason I live here now.",
		"Probably provin' 'em right by doin' so, but I could care less.",
		"You're alright, kid. Probably should get going, though. Don't wanna keep anyone waitin', do ya?",
		
	],
	
	cavesCamperSleep : [ 
	
		"[wave]zzzzzzz...",

	],
	
	cavesSolvingSpotTheDifference : [ 
	
		"I, the great explorer Beckett, have once again been stymied.", 
		"But not for long! My astute powers of observation tell me...",
		"That there must be a secret switch hidden somewhere!",
		"Yes, yes indeed. I must once again keep a keen eye open for anything out of the ordinary.",
	
	],
	
	cavesSpotTheDifferenceHint : [ 
	
		"Hmm. I wonder... is something missing? Or perhaps it's my imagination...", 
	
	],
	
	cavesSpotTheDifferenceHint2 : [ 
	
		//"Hmm. I get the feeling that this switch is hidden well. Perhaps high up. If only I could double jump...", 
		"Hmm. I wonder what became of the miners who built this camp. Were they really going to blow up that doorway?", 
	
	],
	
	cavesSolvedSpotTheDifference : [ 
	
		//"Aha! Once again I, the great explorer Becket, have cracked the uncrackable! My genius knows no bounds!", 
		"Aha! Once again I, the great explorer Becket, have solved the riddle! An elementary task for a sleuthing expert such as myself.", 
	
	],
	
	cavesDwarfMiners : [ 
	
		"[shake]ROCK AND STONE, BROTHER!!",
		"[shake]STONE AND ROCK, BROTHER!!",
		"[shake]ROCK AND ROLL, BROTHER!!",
		//"Personally I'm more of a free-form jazz aficionado.",
		"I hate mining.",
	
	],
	
	cavesHungryMiner : [ 
	
		"Hey! [shake]Back off[/shake], jack! I saw it first!!",
		//"Oh delicious cherry! Won't you be a good girl and come down? [wave]Pretty please?",
		"Oh delicious cherry! Won't you be good and come down? [wave][rainbow]Pretty please?",
		"Try as I may, I simply can't reach you. Not even with my double jump!",
		"If only there was a way to gain a little more height, then I'd feast on your succulent red innards...",
	
	],
	
	cavesHungryMinerHint : [ 
	
		"More height! I need more height! How irritating! It makes me want to [shake]pound the ground[/shake] in anger!",
	
	],
	
	cavesHungryMinerSad : [ 
	
		"I would have gotten it eventually...",
	
	],
	
	cavesMinerByScienceJuice : [ 
	
		//"I found this barrel of dubious substance just sitting here. What do you suppose it is?", 
		"I found that barrel of dubious orange substance just sitting over there. Where did it come from?", 
		//"Looks like toxic sludge if you ask me. I would definitely not jump into that barrel.", 
		"It must be toxic waste. Only a fool would jump in. A dumb, stupid, blithering idiot. Which I can only assume you are. On you go!", 
		//"T-that could be cancer causing radiation sludge for all you know!! You could mutate and grow six hands, or tongues where your eyes are, or, or...", 
	
	],
	
	cavesMinerByScienceJuiceShocked : [ 
	
		//"You jumped in!? You're crazy! A madman! Completely, utterly deranged!!", 
		"I see not only you are unharmed, but you've also gained the magic ability to pound the ground.", 
		"...I regret not jumping in now.", 
		//"...I regret not jumping into the toxic sludge.", 
		//"You've taught me a valuable lesson, friend.", 
		//"And that lesson is: Always jump into toxic sludge. Which I will do from now on. Thanks!", 
	
	],
	
	cavesHaunting : [ 
	
		"Well, salt my eggs. This is not good I tell ya, [slant]not[/slant] good! What was I [slant]thinkin'[/slant], followin' that yellow moron?[spr_npc_explorer]", //0
		"Now I done went and fell in some weird portal and got myself lost! I'm a goner for sure! No one's gonna find me down here!", 
		"Well, on the bright side, at least I won't run into that blue schmuck[spr_pitter_forward] I scammed in the forest. Heh, what a grade-A sucker...", 
		"WAH!", 
		"WHO'S THERE!?", 
		"Oh... it's just a pretty little lady. Well how do [slant]you[/slant] do, ma'am? Lookin' to buy some authentic jewelry?", //5
		"Hm? What's that? Bluey is your husband? And you overheard what I said about scamming him?", 
		"[shake]AHAHA![/shake] So [slant]what[/slant] if I did? Sorry to break it to ya, [slant]missy[/slant], but all sales are final! He can chalk it up as a learning experience!", 
		"Oh, what now? What are you gonna do, [c_orange]pound[/color] the money out of me!? Ha! I'd like to see you try!!", 
	
	],
	
	cavesHauntingPart2 : [ 
	
		"[shake]NO MORE, PLEASE! I YIELD! I YIEEEEEELD!![/shake]", //0
		"[shake]I'm so sorry for scamming your husband, miss!! I won't fleece anyone ever again, I swear on my mum!![/shake]", 
		"Look, I'll even throw in my best parachute, on the house. This one [slant]actually[/slant] works, for real! Just [slant]please[/slant] no more beatings!", 
	//	"It is a one time use, but it'll come in handy sooner or later. Like I said, no strings attached. We square? No more tenderizing? Good.", 
		"It is a one time use, but it'll come in handy. We square now? No more tenderizing?", 
	//	"We square now? No more tenderizing?", 
		"Sheesh, lady. I'm gonna be feeling [slant]that[/slant] in the morning. You really care about Bluey, eh? How touching. Makes me wanna barf.", 
		"So, uh. Any chance you know how to get us out of this dump?", //5
		"Hold on. Do you hear that? What's that noise?", 
		"Oh, I know! That must be miners here to rescue us! We're saved!!", 
		"No?", 
		"What's with that concerned look? You're making me nervous, lady.", 
		"Hide!? From [slant]what!?[/slant] [shake]What's coming!?[/shake]", //10
		"Oh crap oh crap oh crap oh crap oh crap oh crap oh crap oh crap oh crap oh crap!!", 
		"[font_scoreUI]WHAT THE HELL IS EVEN THAT!?[/font]", 
		"Oops. My bad.", 
		//"RUUUUUUN!!!", 
		"[font_scoreUI]RUN!!!", 
	
	],
	
	cavesHauntingNotScammed : [ 
	
		"Well, salt my eggs. This is not good I tell ya, [slant]not[/slant] good! What was I [slant]thinkin'[/slant], followin' that yellow moron?[spr_npc_explorer]",//0 
		"Now I done went and fell in some weird portal and got myself lost! I'm a goner for sure! No one's gonna find me down here!", 
		"And I'm still flat broke to top it off! I couldn't even scam that blue schmuck[spr_pitter_forward] in the forest.", 
		"He just walked right past my parachute and jumped off a cliff without a care in the world! Who [slant]does[/slant] that!?", 
		"WAH!", 
		"WHO'S THERE!?",//5
		"Oh... it's just a pretty little lady. Well how do [slant]you[/slant] do, ma'am? Lookin' to buy some authentic jewelry?", 
		"Hm? What's that? Bluey is your husband? And you overheard what I said about wanting to scam him?", 
		"I assure you, m'lady, that I would never do such a thing as sell a sucker- I mean a [slant]savvy[/slant] customer like him a broken, useless parachute.", 
		"B-but don't take my word for it!! Here, look! A state of the art parachute, on the house! This is my good one! Really!", 
		//"See? No reason to get all worked up, miss. I'm sure your husband is a lovely, intelligent, good-looking guy who would never fall for a scam.",
		//"See? No reason to get all worked up, miss. I'm sure your husband is an intelligent gentleman.",//10
		"See? No reason to get all worked up, miss. Free stuff makes everything better, doesn't it?",//10
	//	"Phew. For a second or two I thought you were going to turn me into a punching bag. Sheesh.",//10
